{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"tv/224941","tmdb_id":224941,"title":"怪奇退休镇","original_title":"The Boroughs","overview":"在幅员广大、艳阳高照的新墨西哥沙漠地带，有一座名为“退休镇”的优美社区，吸引众人在此安享晚年。然而，对刚搬来的山姆·库珀来说，这片天堂更像是冰冷的牢笼。某天晚上，一场可怕的遭遇让他惊觉看似干净的小巷，其实藏着骇人听闻的真相。地方官员对山姆的警告视若无睹，认为他只是老了胡言乱语，但他意外招来了一群同样被视为异类的邻居，包括睿智犀利的前记者、追寻心灵救赎的探索者、愤世嫉俗的音乐经纪人，以及走投无路的天才医生。这群被人看扁的边缘人必须联手揭开退休镇深藏的黑暗秘密，不然时日也不多了！","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIdtLJEJhjZUt8nKDZUYNGL23Uf.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iftYIh1OjJb99EOTHIrDcx59zWb.jpg","first_air_date":"2026-05-21","last_air_date":"2026-05-21","year":"2026","episode_run_time":"","number_of_episodes":8,"number_of_seasons":1,"tmdb_rating_average":5,"tmdb_votes":10,"tmdb_rating":"5 / 10 from 10 users","genres":["Sci-Fi & Fantasy","悬疑"],"languages":["English"],"countries":["United States of America"],"production_companies":["Upside Down Pictures","Off Franklin Productions"],"directors":[],"producers":[{"name":"Jamie Vega Wheeler","id":1813440},{"name":"Joe Lotito","id":1748026}],"cast":[{"id":658,"name":"阿尔弗雷德·莫里纳","original_name":"Alfred Molina","character":"Sam","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/nJo91Czesn6z0d0pkfbDoVZY3sg.jpg"},{"id":16935,"name":"吉娜·戴维斯","original_name":"Geena Davis","character":"Renee","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/bx9ufx5cS7FfHDFFeT71syBh428.jpg"},{"id":1981,"name":"阿尔弗雷·伍达德","original_name":"Alfre Woodard","character":"Judy","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/jaojqEDdOBWfDpQfdWIbvyLDy5z.jpg"},{"id":81681,"name":"丹尼斯·奥黑尔","original_name":"Denis O'Hare","character":"Wally","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/zMim5sdMnyd2GFfPd9Jh59Vcog3.jpg"},{"id":61011,"name":"克拉克·彼得斯","original_name":"Clarke Peters","character":"Art","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/ouDHDpocxXgXrosF3vShAEkOjHL.jpg"},{"id":8984,"name":"比尔·普尔曼","original_name":"Bill Pullman","character":"Jack","image":"https:/